~
Description
他滿臉福福的﹐永遠對人都是一副笑臉﹐讓你也感到心情很愉快﹗
~
AutoSetValue    Yes
Sentinel        Yes
Alignment       0
Level           49
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             5
Int             5
Wis             5
Dex             5
Con             5
Hp              100
Mana            10
Move            10
Class           0
Gold            10
Multipile       100
AttackRatio     100
DodgeRatio      100
Migrate         0
Sex             SEX_MALE
AutoEnable      'long fist'
